{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19955","headline":"罗氏花下奉招陈侍御 · 孟郊","name":"罗氏花下奉招陈侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眼在枝上春，落地成埃尘。\n不是风流者，谁爲攀折人。\n宁辞波浪阔，莫道往来频。\n拾紫岂宜晚，掇芳须及晨。\n劳收贾生泪，强起屈平身。\n花下本无俗，酒中别有神。\n游蜂不饮故，戏蝶亦争新。\n万物尽如此，过时非所珍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}